### 3. Nutrient & Mass Closure

Human + animal waste → biogas (methane) + CO₂ + fertilizer + bone broth → plants and mycelium.  
Selective Hippo-refined N/P/K and micronutrients arrive only when local stocks require top-up.  
Mycelium and FAIRY DUST accelerate decomposition and produce additional edible biomass.  
Process heat from Megablocks maintains growth temperatures.  
Target: >95 % local food mass closure by end of Phase 2.

---

### 4. Preservation, Storage & Multi-Year Buffers

- Root cellars excavated in MOONWORM tunnels (passive thermal stability).  
- Curing, smoking, fermentation, and drying of plant and animal products.  
- Vacuum-compatible packaging and radiation-hardened storage.  
- Multi-year caloric and nutritional buffers sized for crew expansion and catastrophic recovery.

