### 7. Phased Implementation

**Phase 1 (0–6 months)**  
Deliver seed stocks, initial rabbit/duck pairs or germplasm, basic hydroponic/LED modules, and starter mycelium. Establish first production volumes inside early MOONWORM tunnels or tipped hulls. Begin simple nutrient cycling.

**Phase 2 (6–36 months)**  
Full multi-level plant arrays and animal housing online. Mycelium soil systems mature. Closed nutrient loops reach high efficiency. Multi-year buffers and vaults placed. BBQ Sundays ritual begins. Food production fully supports the human + Optimus workforce for FAIRY DUST and early StarMind hardware.

**Phase 3 (3+ years)**  
Scaled production matches base growth. Continuous Grok/StarMind optimization of yields and balances. Local FAIRY DUST manufacturing of improved grow modules and grill units. Near-complete nutritional sovereignty.

