### 9. Closed-Loop Summary

Leg 1 produces the biological foundation that keeps the human + Optimus workforce alive, productive, and psychologically resilient so FAIRY DUST can fabricate StarMind hardware and permanent infrastructure. Waste streams close into Leg 2. Tunnel volume and thermal mass from Legs 3 and 4 become the physical substrate. Selective Hippo nutrients (Leg 0) bootstrap without violating energy-first mass-transfer rules. Mycelium binds the biological and structural domains. The methalox grill ritual turns an existing propellant into a high-value human-factor asset.

The result is nutritional sovereignty that scales with the base and survives catastrophe — the resilience required for a permanent lunar industrial node supporting multi-planetary expansion.

